"There were once others who mattered to me. Long ago. My father and my mother. I was born in the land of water, in a small village where the snow lies deep in the winter. My parents were farmers and very poor. Our life was hard, but we were content. My parents were good to each other and kind to me."

02:04:30.030 --> 02:04:34.470
You were happy once, but then everything changed.

02:04:34.470 --> 02:04:43.480
Because of something that happened long before I was even born, everything changed.

02:04:43.480 --> 02:04:48.390
