Keke genkai?

02:05:23.900 --> 02:05:26.390
The advanced bloodline trait of a clan.

02:05:26.390 --> 02:05:30.000
Its jutsu and abilities passed down from generations

02:05:30.000 --> 02:05:36.640
to generation. Because of their unique abilities, the clans were used as mercenaries. They fought

02:05:36.640 --> 02:05:41.860
in many battles and were much feared. But when the wars were over, they were despised

02:05:41.860 --> 02:05:47.220
and shunned by the people, who feared their presence would only bring more war and misfortune.

02:05:49.580 --> 02:05:56.990
So it was that after the wars, these clans went into hiding, denying the bloodline trait

02:05:56.990 --> 02:06:00.000
that flowed in their veins. Concealing

02:06:00.000 --> 02:06:06.030
their unique abilities. Knowing that to be discovered meant certain death. If you had

02:06:06.030 --> 02:06:11.320
searched that boy's memories, I'm sure you would have found it there, too. The cruelty

02:06:11.320 --> 02:06:18.890
of people. Their fear of things they don't understand. For years, my mother was successful

02:06:18.890 --> 02:06:24.480
in hiding her bloodline trait. She met and fell in love with a simple farmer. And they

02:06:24.480 --> 02:06:30.000
were married. And after that, my mother thought she would lead a peaceful, ordinary life to

02:06:30.000 --> 02:06:32.000
