02:08:30.160 --> 02:08:37.480
and your mother and father? What? My purpose. In all the world, there was no one who needed me.

02:08:37.940 --> 02:08:48.230
I was unnecessary. Just like me. Why is it you're so determined to be Hokage? Because you want all

